{"id": "unknown-2026-11-04-007", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Bangladesh garment unrest turns violent, threatening global sourcing", "content": "Nearly 690 Bangladesh garment factories suspended production on November 2 after wage protests triggered clashes, vandalism and road blockades; many later reopened.\nWorkers seek a Tk 30,000 minimum wage, up 140 per cent, while the wage board has only set a December effective date.\nExports are mixed: EU imports fell and US share edged up, while TexPro shows T-shirt and men’s woven pressure.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/bangladesh-garment-unrest-turns-violent-threatening-global-sourcing-314813-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-04-008", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "US cotton tariff plan: Will 4 Asian rivals gain on Vietnam in 2027?", "content": "Washington plans 2027 cotton-linked tariff-rate quotas for four Asian apparel exporters, letting eligible shipments avoid an extra 10 per cent Section 301 duty.\nVietnam, the top buyer of US cotton at $1.28 billion in 2025, is excluded despite a 21.59 per cent US apparel import share.\nTexPro says US knitted/woven apparel imports fell 7.02 per cent in January-August 2026; rules remain unpublished.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/us-cotton-tariff-plan-will-4-asian-rivals-gain-on-vietnam-in-2027--314808-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-04-009", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Bangladesh's 3-year LDC extension: Can it reverse a $445 mn EU slide?", "content": "Bangladesh’s LDC graduation was extended to November 24, 2029, but around 690 garment factories suspended production days later amid wage protests.\nTexPro data shows EU imports from Bangladesh in six apparel categories fell 4.69 per cent, or $445.5 million, in January–July 2026.\nBangladesh’s share slipped as China and Vietnam gained, while EU duty-free access may extend into late 2032.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/bangladesh-s-3-year-ldc-extension-can-it-reverse-a-445-mn-eu-slide--314805-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-04-010", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["weak", "pressure"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India's polyester, viscose yarn markets weaken amid sluggish demand", "content": "India’s polyester and viscose yarn markets stayed under pressure as weak demand, payment constraints and lower crude oil prices weighed.\nPolyester yarn eased in Surat and was mixed in Ludhiana; viscose yarn fell ₹3–4 (~$0.03–0.04) per kg in Mumbai but stayed stable in Surat.\nNorth India cotton lost ₹30–50 per maund amid weak ICE futures and subdued mill buying, even as arrivals stagnated at 14,000 bales.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-s-polyester-viscose-yarn-markets-weaken-amid-sluggish-demand-314799-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-04-011", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "BTMA targets stronger UK-India partnerships at India ITME 2026", "content": "BTMA will use India ITME 2026, taking place on 4–9 December in Greater Noida, to strengthen UK–India textile machinery partnerships and expand export opportunities.\nSupported by the UK–India Textile Machinery Coalition, members will showcase innovations in automated fabric inspection, laboratory testing and colour assessment to support efficient, competitive and sustainable manufacturing.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/btma-targets-stronger-uk-india-partnerships-at-india-itme-2026-314797-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-11-04-012", "date": "2026-11-04", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 11, "week": 45, "weekday": "Wed"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Stäubli to introduce S3292 dobby at India ITME 2026", "content": "Stäubli will introduce its S3292 dobby for high-speed air-jet weaving at India ITME 2026 in Greater Noida on 4–9 December.\nDesigned for up to 12 frames and speeds of up to 1,200 rpm, it targets denim producers and Indian mills.\nThe showcase in Hall 14, Booth B2 will also feature automatic drawing-in, warp knotting, cam motions, Jacquard systems and digital services.", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/st-ubli-to-introduce-s3292-dobby-at-india-itme-2026-314793-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
